      "params": {
        "text": "Attractor field\n\nThree forces wired into the World: turbulence (perlin field), drag (terminal velocity), and an attractor pulling everything toward (0, 0).\n\nThe attractor's `viz` output draws its influence ring — toggle `showViz` to debug placement.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 260
      },
